 "hardware": {
  "gpu": "NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB",
  "why": "the teacher's 262144-token context needs ~36 GiB of KV cache for one full-length sequence (36 layers x 8 KV heads x 128 x 2 x bf16 = 144 KiB/token), which does not fit beside the weights on a 48 GB card; an 80 GB card holds it without lowering the context (P18)"
 },
